{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Hled\u00e1 a \u010dte ofici\u00e1ln\u00ed \u010deskou dokumentaci SHOPZI, n\u00e1vody k administraci i dokumentaci pro v\u00fdvoj\u00e1\u0159e (fulltextov\u011b, zdarma). `mode: \"search\"` s `query` vr\u00e1t\u00ed nejv\u00fd\u0161 8 \u00faryvk\u016f, `mode: \"read\"` se `slug` z hled\u00e1n\u00ed vr\u00e1t\u00ed \u010dl\u00e1nek nebo jeho kapitolu. Pou\u017eij ho, kdy\u017e se \u010dlov\u011bk pt\u00e1, jak se v SHOPZI n\u011bco d\u011bl\u00e1 nebo jak se k obchodu p\u0159ipojit.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"docs":{"description":"Jen u `search`: `uzivatele` = n\u00e1vody k administraci, `vyvojari` = dokumentace pro v\u00fdvoj\u00e1\u0159e. Vynechan\u00e9 = ob\u011b.","enum":["uzivatele","vyvojari"],"type":"string"},"heading":{"description":"Jen u `read`: n\u00e1zev kapitoly (H2), kdy\u017e sta\u010d\u00ed jej\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st. Nezn\u00e1m\u00fd n\u00e1zev vr\u00e1t\u00ed jen nadpisy.","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"mode":{"description":"search = naj\u00edt v n\u00e1vodech (vy\u017eaduje `query`); read = p\u0159e\u010d\u00edst \u010dl\u00e1nek (vy\u017eaduje `slug`).","enum":["search","read"],"type":"string"},"query":{"description":"Jen u `search`: ot\u00e1zka vlastn\u00edmi slovy.","maxLength":500,"type":"string"},"section":{"description":"Jen u `search`: z\u00fa\u017e\u00ed hled\u00e1n\u00ed na jednu sekci dokumentace.","enum":["prehled","zaciname","produkty","objednavky","doprava-a-platby","marketing","vzhled","nastaveni","vyvojari"],"type":"string"},"slug":{"description":"Jen u `read`: identifik\u00e1tor \u010dl\u00e1nku z hled\u00e1n\u00ed.","maxLength":120,"type":"string"}},"required":["mode"],"type":"object"},"name":"shopzi_docs","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"article":{"anyOf":[{"additional